{% block prose %}
<div class="callout">
  <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> Wix is fine software and the subscription is cheap. But the subscription was never the cost — the build is, and with DIY the builder is you. Price your own hours at your charge-out rate and the "cheap" option is usually the most expensive one on the table. If your evenings are worth more than a website admin's, don't become one.</p>
</div>

